0.07 0.3 0.47 setrgbcolor /Helvetica-Bold findfont 11.2 scalefont setfont 46.0 681.0 moveto (Abstract) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 667.0 moveto (Reversing a tractor-trailer into a loading dock is a challenging control problem because the vehicle is) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 656.6 moveto (nonlinear, nonholonomic, underactuated, and unstable while moving backward. Small steering errors can cause) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 646.2 moveto (the articulation angle to grow and lead to jackknifing. This project proposes a modular simulated autonomy) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 635.8 moveto (system that plans and executes a safe reverse-docking maneuver at a logistics service center. A path) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 625.4 moveto (planner will produce a reference trajectory to a selected loading door, and a trajectory-aware Proximal) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 615.0 moveto (Policy Optimization \(PPO\) controller will steer the vehicle along it. A model-based controller will provide) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 604.6 moveto (a conventional baseline. The system will first be developed in a lightweight two-dimensional environment) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 594.2 moveto (and then transferred to a three-dimensional MuJoCo simulation. Performance will be evaluated over) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 583.8 moveto (randomized scenarios using docking success, collision and jackknife rates, final pose error, maneuver time,) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 573.4 moveto (steering smoothness, and controller computation time.) show
0.07 0.3 0.47 setrgbcolor /Helvetica-Bold findfont 11.2 scalefont setfont 46.0 557.0 moveto (Problem and Research Question) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 543.0 moveto (The system receives the tractor and trailer configuration, a static map, and the pose of a selected loading) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 532.6 moveto (dock. It must place the trailer within a specified position and orientation tolerance while avoiding) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 522.2 moveto (obstacles, respecting steering limits, and maintaining a safe articulation angle. The central research) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 511.8 moveto (question is: Can a PPO controller using trajectory-relative preview information reliably reverse a tractor-) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 501.4 moveto (trailer into a dock, and how does it compare with a model-based controller under changes in starting pose,) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 491.0 moveto (vehicle parameters, and observation noise?) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 477.6 moveto (We hypothesize that trajectory-relative observations will be easier to learn from than raw global) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 467.2 moveto (coordinates. The model-based controller is expected to provide strong nominal safety and accuracy, while) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 456.8 moveto (PPO may offer fast online control and greater tolerance to moderate model variation after suitable) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 446.4 moveto (training.) show
0.07 0.3 0.47 setrgbcolor /Helvetica-Bold findfont 11.2 scalefont setfont 46.0 430.0 moveto (Objectives and Scope) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 416.0 moveto (The project has five primary objectives:) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 57.0 402.6 moveto (1. Implement and validate a low-speed tractor-trailer kinematic model.) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 57.0 391.4 moveto (2. Develop reference-path generation and path-relative error measurements.) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 57.0 380.2 moveto (3. Implement a conventional trajectory-tracking baseline, preferably nonlinear model predictive control) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 57.0 369.8 moveto (\(NMPC\).) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 57.0 358.6 moveto (4. Train a PPO controller for reverse trajectory following and docking.) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 57.0 347.4 moveto (5. Integrate the planner and controllers with a 3D logistics-yard simulation and compare them) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 57.0 337.0 moveto (quantitatively.) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 325.8 moveto (The core scope includes one tractor, one conventional semitrailer, static obstacles, a known map, a known) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 315.4 moveto (target dock pose, and low-speed operation. Simulator ground truth will initially provide localization so) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 305.0 moveto (that planning and control can be evaluated independently. Simulated LiDAR mapping and camera-based dock-) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 294.6 moveto (number recognition are extensions rather than core requirements. Dynamic traffic, multiple trailers, high-) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 284.2 moveto (speed dynamics, and an end-to-end sensor-to-steering policy are outside the core scope.) show
0.07 0.3 0.47 setrgbcolor /Helvetica-Bold findfont 11.2 scalefont setfont 46.0 267.8 moveto (Proposed Method) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 253.8 moveto (Development will begin with a Python/Gymnasium-style 2D environment. The vehicle state will include tractor) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 243.4 moveto (position and heading, trailer heading, articulation angle, steering angle, and velocity. Collision,) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 233.0 moveto (jackknife, and parking-success checks will be implemented before controller training. Early tests will) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 222.6 moveto (cover straight reversing, constant-steering motion, and recovery from small initial articulation angles.) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 209.2 moveto (The planner will initially supply predefined straight and curved paths, followed by a Reeds-Shepp or Hybrid) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 198.8 moveto (A*-based reference generator if time permits. Because a car-like path does not guarantee a safe trailer) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 188.4 moveto (articulation history, all generated paths will be checked through the tractor-trailer model.) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 175.0 moveto (The PPO observation will emphasize trailer lateral error, truck and trailer heading errors, articulation) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 164.6 moveto (angle, steering state, distance to the goal, and several preview points along the path. The action will be) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 154.2 moveto (a bounded steering or steering-rate command at a fixed low reverse speed. The reward will combine progress,) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 143.8 moveto (tracking accuracy, steering smoothness, successful docking, collision avoidance, and jackknife prevention.) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 133.4 moveto (Safety limits will also be enforced by termination or a separate supervisor rather than only through reward) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 123.0 moveto (penalties.) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 109.6 moveto (The conventional baseline will minimize tracking, articulation, and steering costs while respecting vehicle) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 99.2 moveto (constraints. After validation in 2D, both controllers will be connected through a common interface to the) show
0 0 0 setrgbcolor /Helvetica findfont 8.8 scalefont setfont 46.0 88.8 moveto (same articulated MuJoCo vehicle and logistics-yard scene.) show
